message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "BikeLab FIT Analyzer"
version: 2.0.0
date-released: 2026-11-23
type: software
license: PolyForm-Noncommercial-1.0.0
authors:
  - family-names: "Ravello Joo"
    given-names: "Carlos Eduardo"
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0007-5631-7436"
    affiliation: "BikeLab Studio"
repository-code: "https://github.com/carlosravello-png/bikelab-fit-analyzer"
url: "https://www.bikelabstudio.com/articles/fit-analyzer-en"
abstract: >-
  Browser-only analyzer for cycling .fit activity files. The FIT reader is validated
  field by field against the Garmin FIT SDK and fitdecode on public test files.
  Metrics: cadence stability, speed/cadence stability, climbing stability, Variability
  Index (NP/AP) and power:heart-rate decoupling, with Monte Carlo uncertainty bands.
keywords:
  - cycling
  - FIT file
  - normalized power
  - variability index
  - cadence
  - Monte Carlo
